  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UN Resident Coordinator&apos;s Office UNRCO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to ensure that the Resident Coordinator (RC) and the Resident Coordinator&apos;s Office (RCO) can continue to coordinate and follow up the UN reform and Develivering as One (DaO) and support the UN country team (UNCT) and the development partners (DPs)  RCO has three thematic areas of delivery: coordination (development and humanitarian/resilience; analysis and information management/communication.</narrative>
  </description>
